tem_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/d5128639672b23147b52349d87dcc84e.mp4?t=1755203052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MULTI-TABLE TOURNAMENTS (MTT) &amp; TRILLIONAIRE MAKER:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against hundreds or thousands of players across multiple tables. The marquee Trillionaire Maker guarantees a first-place prize of TRILLIONS OF CHIPS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEAGUES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join millions of players worldwide in our online Poker Season competition. Win the most chips to rise to the top and become the Texas Poker champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zynga Poker is the ultimate destination for poker players, card fans, and tournament enthusiasts. Join our exciting poker community today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/bc1ff0a9b47da766a36190fdeb6a2ded.poster.avif?t=1755203052\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/bc1ff0a9b47da766a36190fdeb6a2ded.webm?t=1755203052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/bc1ff0a9b47da766a36190fdeb6a2ded.mp4?t=1755203052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
